#: ../../webgis-src/chb3_mapserver-cgi/sec02_mode/section.rst:246
msgid "Special character"
msgstr "特殊字符"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb3_mapserver-cgi/sec02_mode/section.rst:248
msgid ""
"A template is simply an HTML file or URL string that contains special "
"characters replaced by mapserv each time the template is processed. "
"Simple substitution allows information such as the active layer or space "
"range to be passed from the user to mapserv and back again. In most "
"cases, the new value is dumped into the form variable that will be passed"
" again. Here is a list of special characters and form variables. HTML "
"templates can contain anything, including JavaScript and Java calls."
msgstr "模板只是一个包含在每次处理模板时被mapserv替换的特殊字符的HTML文件或URL字符串。简单的替换允许将活动层或空间范围等信息从用户传递到映射服务器，然后再传递回来。在大多数情况下，新值被转储到将再次传递的表单变量中。以下是特殊字符和表单变量的列表。HTML模板可以包含任何内容，包括JavaScript和Java调用。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb3_mapserver-cgi/sec02_mode/section.rst:257
msgid ""
"In HTML files, attribute values can be enclosed in quotation marks "
"(``\"\"``). Writing property values within quotes allows you to set "
"special characters that the value does not normally use (such as: ``]``, "
"``=``, ``\"``, and spaces. To write single quotes within the property "
"value, only Use two quotation marks (``\"\"``)."
msgstr ""
"在HTML文件中，属性值可以用引号引起来 (``\"\"`` )。通过在引号中写入属性值，您可以设置值通常不使用的特殊字符(例如：  ``]`` "
"，  ``=`` ，  ``\"`` 和空格。要在属性值中使用单引号，请仅使用两个引号 (``\"\"`` )。"

