msgid ""
"Being able to turn map layers on and off is a standard feature of web "
"mapping applications. There are many ways to accomplish this using form "
"objects as control. You can use the drop box/menu, check boxes, and/or "
"radio buttons. In this example you'll see how to implement layer "
"selection using check boxes and drop boxes."
